{"id":"pozhaluj","lemma":"пожалуй","pos":"adv","rank":691,"glosses":["maybe, perhaps","I suppose (hesitant agreement or acceptance after some thought)"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/0/02/Ru-%D0%BF%D0%BE%D0%B6%D0%B0%D0%BB%D1%83%D0%B9.ogg/Ru-%D0%BF%D0%BE%D0%B6%D0%B0%D0%BB%D1%83%D0%B9.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Мы, пожалуй, пойдём с тобой.","en":"I think we'll go with you.","words":[{"g":"we"},null,{"g":"to go","l":"пойти"},{"g":"with / from"},{"g":"you","l":"ты"}]},{"text":"Я, пожалуй, лучше сделаю это.","en":"I guess I'd better do this.","words":[{"g":"I"},null,{"g":"rather, would better )"},{"g":"to make, to do","l":"сделать"},{"g":"this / it is"}]},{"text":"Я, пожалуй, пойду обратно спать.","en":"I think I'll go back to sleep.","words":[{"g":"I"},null,{"g":"to go","l":"пойти"},{"g":"back, backwards"},{"g":"to sleep"}]},{"text":"Я, пожалуй, лучше пойду с тобой.","en":"I think I'd better go with you.","words":[{"g":"I"},null,{"g":"rather, would better )"},{"g":"to go","l":"пойти"},{"g":"with / from"},{"g":"you","l":"ты"}]},{"text":"Пожалуй, теперь я наконец понимаю.","en":"I think I finally understand now.","words":[null,{"g":"now, at present"},{"g":"I"},{"g":"at last, finally"},{"g":"to understand","l":"понимать"}]}]}